    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekia kughalua wandu winughe dini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Ndima yasia, wandu wose wa Israeli werekoghe aho, wikaghenda mizinyi ya Juda, wikachikanya nguro retasa vipande vipande, na kuinja fwana ra ghuja mlungu ghwa waka Ashera, na kunona andu kotasira mighondinyi, na madhabahu riko andenyi ya isanga ja Juda, na Benjamini, na Efraimu, na Manase, hata wikaritotesha rose. Niko wandu wose wa Israeli wikawuya mizinyi kwawo kula mundu andu kwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia ukawika vipughi va wakohani na Walawi, kula kipughi kwa ifungu kunughana na wudumiki ghwaro ghwa wukohani angu ghwa Walawi wipate kufunya vizongona vekora na va mapatano, kudumika mbengenyi ya Andu Kokaia kwa BWANA; kufunya chawucha na kubora makaso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafunyo gha mzuri kufuma kwa mali rake moni, ghedeeka kwa wundu ghwa vizongona vekora va nakesho na va luma lwa kenyi, vizongona vekora va Sabato, va Mori Lukombe, na va ndima zima riwikilo sa iji iandikilo Sharienyi ya BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mit. 28.1–29.39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukafunya momu wandu werekoghe Jerusalemu wifunye mafunyo kwa wundu gha wakohani na Walawi, eri wipate kukufunya kuidumikia Sharia ya BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.12+NUM.18.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit. 18.12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Momu ugho ghuendaereshwa woruwu, wandu wa Israeli wikafunya mavalo ghawo gha imbiri gha viro kwa wungi: divei, mavuda, wuki, na mavalo ghose gha mbuwenyi; wikareda ifungu ja ikumi ja kula kilambo kwa wungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokoni wandu wa Israeli na Juda, awo werekoghe wikikaia mizinyi ya Juda, wikareda ifungu ja ikumi ja ng'ombe, ng'ondi, na vilambo viwikilo wakfu, ivo werevifunyireghe kwa BWANA Mlungu wawo; wikaviwika kitungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mori ghwa kadadu, wikazoya kutumbanya ivo vitungu nokoighu; wikavimeria mori ghwa mfungade. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji Hezekia na wanjama wake wacha na kuwona ivo vitungu, wikamkasa BWANA, na wandu wake Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia ukawikotia wakohani na Walawi malagho gha ivo vitungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkohani M'baa Azaria uo orekoghe wa kivalwa cha Zadoku ukamtumbulia, “Kufuma wazoya kureda michango Hekalunyi, dajie dikaghuda, dikasigara kwa wungi; dasigharika na vindo vilazi angu BWANA uwirasimie wandu wake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Hezekia ukafunya momu wiboise vumba andenyi ya Hekalu, nawo wikaboisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kwa wuloli wikavingira ivo vilambo vifunyiro; ifungu ja ikumi, na vilambo viwikilo wakfu. M'baa wa kazi orekoghe ukivilindia ni Konamia, Mlawi; wa kawi ni mruna uwangwagha Shimei; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikiteselwa ni Jehieli, Azazia, Nahathi, Asaheli, Jerimothi, Jozabadi, Elieli, Ismakia, Mahathi, na Benaia. Wikakaia wazighaniri wemtesia Konania na mruna Shimei; nawo werewikiloghe ni Mzuri Hezekia na Mkohani M'baa Azaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kore, mwana wa Imna, Mlawi mlindiri wa mbenge ya mashariki, orekoghe mzighaniri wa vizongona vifunyiro kwa Mlungu kwa ngolo; upate kuviwagha ivo vilambo viwikilo mbai kwa wundu ghwa BWANA, na ivo va wueli vichumbie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edeni, Miniamini, Jeshua, Shemaia, Amaria na Shekamia, werekoghe waloli kwa kumtesia Kore kuwaghia waruna wabaa na watini karakara, kunughana na vipughi va wakohani werekoghe andenyi ya mizi yawo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "awo wisereandikiloghe kwa vichuku. Womi kufuma wa miaka mirongo idadu na kuchumba, awo wose weredimieghe kungia Hekalunyi kwa wudumiki werewaghiloghe, seji kazi ra kula ituku rerekundikieghe, kunughana na malalo ghawo gha kazi kwa vipughi vawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakohani wereandikishiroghe kunughana na nyumba ra weke ndee, na Walawi wa miaka mirongo iwi na kuchumba wereandikishiroghe kunughana na kazi rawo kwa vipughi vawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakohani wereandikishiroghe chiaimweri na wana wawo watini wose; waka wawo, wana wawo wa womi na wa waka, ijo izungu jose; angu werekoghe waloli kwa kukuelesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakohani wa kivalwa cha Haruni, werekoghe andu korewikiloghe chiaro kukaie kwa mizi yawo; aho korekoghe wandu wiwikilo andenyi ya mizi milazi, wimanyikagha kwa marina, wikaie na kazi ewaghia wandu wa womi vindo aghadi ya wakohani, na aghadi ya kula umu wa Walawi wereandikishiroghe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huwo niko Hezekia orebonyereghe andenyi ya Juda yose; ukabonya nicha, na kukaia mloli imbiri ya BWANA Mlungu wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula kazi ya wudumiki ghwa Hekalu oreibonyereghe, kunughana na Sharia na malaghiro, ukimlola Mlungu wake, oreibonyereghe kwa ngolo yake yose, nao ukawona nicha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
